// smoke:visual-generation gate (P8, ADR-007/ADR-008).
// Reference-first scenes through the fake ImageProvider and fake S3
// boundary: AI-assembled requests pin visualProfile + reference versions in
// one coordinate frame; backgrounds carry hidden coverage; foregrounds keep
// real alpha; depth stays honest about bit depth. Generation is
// owner-selected (single or batch); a rejected asset regenerates alone
// while approved siblings keep their immutable keys.
// Prior art PASS style: smoke-image-prompt.mts, smoke-image-batch.mts,
// smoke-visual-system.mts.
